#QLCIR-G1
# name: demorgan_channels_k3_d3_fwd
# family: physics/complemented-channels
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Logical relation between a coarse detector event and the event that none of its constituent channels occurs.
# note: One-sided difference test for De Morgan equivalence between exclusion of a 3-channel coarse event and simultaneous exclusion of every channel.
dim(3)
output(8)
1 = or(ch0, ch1, ch2)
2 = not(1)
3 = not(ch0)
4 = not(ch1)
5 = not(ch2)
6 = and(3, 4, 5)
7 = not(6)
8 = and(2, 7)
